# Session transcripts, their cost logs, and the harness that relays a phase between two
# agents. Git carries the history; a pass record in the tree is process narration, which
# CLAUDE.md keeps out of the repository.
runs/
run-*.sh
# Bulk downloads, the database, and run logs stay out; versioned claim sets, the
# verifier's smoke set and selection record, and the demo graph do not — those are the
# evidence a gate ran and the artifact the quickstart renders without a key.
data/*
!data/claimsets/
!data/demo/
!data/verifier/
